# This repository is a whitelist. Everything is ignored by default and only the
# material listed in Appendix G of the dissertation is tracked. Paths below are
# relative to dissertation_project/, matching the appendix.
#
# Deliberately excluded:
#   literature source PDFs   downloaded papers and example theses; third-party copyright
#   course_official/         university regulations and marking criteria; not mine to publish
#   planning drafts          chapter drafts; the submitted PDF is the deliverable
#   model weights            identified instead by SHA-256 in Appendix A

/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/requirements.txt
!/benchmark_plan/
!/benchmark_results/
!/literature/
!/planning/

# literature: written records only, never the downloaded source PDFs
/literature/*
!/literature/*.md

# planning: the official word-count script only
/planning/*
!/planning/wordcount_official.py

__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.gguf
~$*

# working backups, not part of the record
_backup_*
*.BAK-*

# working planning template, not a verification record
literature/literature_matrix.md
